Evening fell.
It was time to go back to Mumbai.
I went to the station.
My train was standing at the platform.
I picked up my own bag.
I got into the train and sat in my seat.
The train started going down the mountains.
It was completely dark outside.
The passenger in front of me took out his water bottle.
I also drank water from my own bottle.
Then I closed my eyes.
Two hours later, I reached Mumbai.
I came to my apartment by taxi.
I reached home late at night.
The house was very quiet.
Today I walked a lot all day.
Because of that, my legs were very tired.
But my mind was completely refreshed.
This was a beautiful trip.
